    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "O`Farrell Cleere are delighted to present 45 Beverton Meadows to the market, a well presented three bedroom family home ideally positioned in this popular residential development in Donabate.\n \nUpon entering, you are greeted by a welcoming entrance hallway with wood effect laminate flooring and useful freestanding storage with radiator cover. To the right is the formal living room, a bright and comfortable space featuring the same wood effect flooring, a feature fireplace with open fire and an attractive bay window overlooking the front of the property. Double doors lead through to the bright open plan kitchen/dining area.\n \nThe kitchen is fitted with a good range of wall and floor units, integrated oven and hob and is plumbed for a dishwasher. There is excellent natural light throughout with double doors opening directly onto the large rear garden, complemented by a window overlooking the garden. Off the kitchen is a separate utility area with additional storage and plumbing for a washing machine.\n \nA guest WC completes the ground floor, with tiled flooring, WC, wash hand basin and tiled splash back.\n \nUpstairs, the stairs and landing are carpeted, with a particularly useful, shelved storage cupboard located off the landing.\n \nTo the front of the property are two bedrooms. Bedroom Two is a spacious double bedroom with laminate flooring and built-in wardrobes, while Bedroom Three is a single bedroom currently suited to use as a nursery, home office or study.\n \nThe recently renovated family bathroom is finished to an excellent standard and features a large walk-in shower with rainfall shower head and separate shower connection, floating wash hand basin with integrated storage, WC, heated towel rail, fitted illuminated mirror and built-in shelving. The shower also benefits from a recessed shelf, with the room fully tiled and fitted with an extractor fan.\n \nTo the rear is the impressive primary bedroom, a generous double bedroom with two windows overlooking the rear garden. The room benefits from fitted wardrobes and plenty of additional space for free standing storage, a chest of drawers or vanity area.\n \nThe attic is accessed via a Stira and is fully floored providing excellent additional storage space.\n \nOutside, the property benefits from a large rear garden, offering excellent potential for family use, entertaining or further landscaping.\n \nOverall, 45 Beverton Meadows is a lovely family home offering well proportioned accommodation, a recently upgraded bathroom, generous outdoor space and excellent potential for its new owners. Its location in Donabate provides easy access to local schools, shops, sporting facilities, transport links and the beautiful North Dublin coastline.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\nWith wood effect flooring.\n\nLiving Room - 3.63m (11'11\") x 5.57m (18'3\")\nBay window to front providing lots of natural light, feature fireplace with inset fire, wood effect laminate flooring continues, double half glazed doors through to the Dining Area.\n\nKitchen - 2.69m (8'10\") x 2.66m (8'9\")\nWell appointed with range of floor and wall mounted units, further window overlooking the rear garden. Built in appliances include an oven and hob with extractor over, space for a dishwasher and large fridge freezer.\n\nDining Area - 3.08m (10'1\") x 5.08m (16'8\")\nWith tiled floor, space for dining table and chairs. The patio doors leading to the rear garden provide lots of natural light.\n\nUtility\nWith plumbing for washing machine, work surface, storage cupboards, tiled flooring.\n\nGuest WC\nWhite suite comprising wash hand basin, WC and tiled floor.\n\nLanding\nWith large storage cupboard, access via a Stira to the floored attic space\n\nBedroom One (rear) - 4.71m (15'5\") x 3.77m (12'4\")\nSituated to the rear overlooking the garden. Two windows provide lots of natural light, built in wardrobe, laminate flooring.\n\nBedroom Two - 2.65m (8'8\") x 4.01m (13'2\")\nTo the front of the property, with laminate flooring and built in wardrobe.\n\nBedroom Three - 1.96m (6'5\") x 4.01m (13'2\")\nTo the front of the property, currently set up as an office with laminate flooring. Large cupboard and further storage and shelving area.\n\nBathroom - 2.32m (7'7\") x 2.04m (6'8\")\nWell appointed fully tiled with large walk in shower with rainfall shower head and inset shelf. Wash hand basin with two drawers storage under, mirror over. WC, heated towel rail. Further inset shelving providing good storage.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> South facing rear garden </li><li> Large, well proportioned garden </li><li> Three bedroom family home </li><li> Recently renovated family bathroom </li><li> Bright open plan kitchen/dining area </li><li> Spacious master bedroom with fitted wardrobes </li><li> Cobble-lock patio with extension potential </li><li> Floored attic with Stira access </li><li> Less than 15 minute walk to train station and Donabate village </li><li> Large Aldi supermarket is within a 5 minute drive</li></ul>"
